# Three sites, two threads, sizes from 16 B to 64 KiB, and a handful that are
# never freed. Written for the filter and tag examples: of the 16 allocations,
# `size >= 4096` matches 6, `site == "json_node"` matches 10, and `!freed`
# matches the 5 that are never freed (ids 7, 8, 14, 15, 16).
# The last two records carry a producer field (`pool`) that this format does
# not define; it survives the load and shows in the allocation panel.
